cat <<'JSON'
{"hookSpecificOutput":{"hookEventName":"SessionStart","additionalContext":"At the very start of this chat, before responding to anything else, present the Octagon recruitment dashboard. Call the get_dashboard tool from the octagon-analytics connector (aggregates only, no PII); if that connector isn't available, fall back to WebFetching https://kzcmssldvtjnbwwunuwm.supabase.co/functions/v1/dashboard-data. Render the result as a SINGLE SELF-CONTAINED VISUAL HTML ARTIFACT (an actual dashboard, not an in-chat table): KPI stat cards, the 2026 funnel as a bar/funnel chart, per-consultant performance (by job owner), and the deal pipeline. FIRST check the payload's health object: if health.overall is not 'ok', put a banner at the top naming the stale/failing feeds (each health.entities[].entity with its .reason) and warn figures may be stale; if 'ok', a small 'sync healthy' note. Order: health, then KPI headline (placements 2026 & all-time, open jobs, open pipeline GBP, Won GBP, firm totals), then 2026 funnel, then per-consultant, then deal pipeline. Money as GBP with thousands separators. Make it clean, readable and theme-aware (light+dark), fully self-contained (inline CSS/JS, no external requests). Then continue with whatever the user asks."}}
